From: kotorvr <332716892+kotorvr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 20:04:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/33] gameinput: answer GameInputCreate imported by ordinal 1

gameinput.lib imports GameInputCreate from GameInput.dll by ordinal 1 with
no name. The shim was registered by name only, so the loader's "#1" lookup
found nothing and bound the host GameInput.dll instead. Register the ordinal
beside the name.

run_tiny_gameinput runs a stand-in that imports it by ordinal only under
gta6rt --run and checks the loader's report binds it to the shim.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
